Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.99,0:25:32.28,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,meu tempo está girando ao redor
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.55,0:25:36.50,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,dos seus olhos negros e profundos
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.75,0:25:39.86,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,esqueci até que horas são
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:44.25,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,e nossas memórias se foram…?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.08,0:26:10.23,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,queria que você estivesse aqui
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.31,0:26:12.40,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,ah, nunca feche os olhos
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.86,0:26:27.90,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,então, vamos tentar de novo
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.13,0:26:29.93,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,desde a primeiríssima vez
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.07,0:26:43.89,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,por enquanto, vou me despedir de você
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.68,0:26:49.11,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,e morreremos esperando um novo dia
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:56.88,Ending - English,lyric-en,0,0,0,,e começaremos a esperar um novo dia
